he restore reverted the material and made it stale. Ticking checkboxes is attestation-safe and is NOT the reason.\n2. REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION=us-east-1 rebar transition standard-hyperbolic-marabou in_progress closed, from this worktree so the merged commit carrying the rebar-ticket trailer is reachable from HEAD.\n\nNo further pushes or submits are needed; nothing is in flight."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786622332863285001,"uuid":"91c1e532-4851-4d6b-ad2a-6f1b2f4512b8"}